      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Exams frequently test the differences between the Arabian Sea and Bay of Bengal branches of the South-West Monsoon.",
        "Be prepared for questions on the opposite impacts of El Niño (suppresses monsoon) and La Niña (enhances monsoon).",
